You can make sure to predict in the response scale (instead linear predictor) setting the same link in both stack. For example
  obs.stack <- inla.stack(data=list(..., link='log'), ...)
  pred.stack <- inla.stack(data=list(..., link='log'), ...)
best,
Elias.

